apps.description:
Mountain Bike Xtreme allows you to become a professional biker and challenge your skills on epic trails. Perform tricks, get points, unlock new trails and improve your skills. 

Features:
- realistic physics. 
- procedurally generated trails;
- day and night cycle;
- dynamic weather system.

Get ready for a bone-chilling horror adventure in MadGran, the ultimate mobile game. Find hidden objects, solve creepy dark riddles, find secret rooms.
MadGran, the scary granny, is back with more terrifying tricks up her sleeve, and you must find a way to escape from her clutches. Immerse yourself in this chilling adventure full of horror, escape, and dark riddles that will test your courage and wits.

💀 You find yourself trapped in granny's house in the forest, a scary and mystery place filled with scary stuff that will make your blood run cold. Creepy granny traps lurk around every corner, you must navigate through dangerous rooms, solve dark riddles and uncover the secrets hidden in the house.

🔪🩸 But be warned, granny's house is no ordinary place. It's filled with traps, obstacles, and creepy surprises that will keep you on edge at all times. Can you muster the bravery to overcome the horrors and escape her clutches?

👻 As you progress, you'll unravel a chilling story behind granny's past and the secrets of the house in the forest. Use your keen senses and puzzle-solving skills to solve dark riddles, unlock hidden passages, and gather clues that will aid your escape.

🧩 MadGran: Scary Horror Escape features stunning graphics and realistic sound effects that will immerse you in its creepy atmosphere. It's an adventure like no other, with heart-pounding moments, jump scares, and intense gameplay that will keep you on the edge of your seat.
Explore the dark and foreboding rooms of granny's house, solve dark riddles and challenging puzzles.

☠️ Experience all the horrors of the spooky game MadGran:
- scary story and spooky atmosphere;
- hide and seek with stealth elements;
- evil maniac psychopath;
- horror puzzle with tricky riddles;
- gloomy quest with mysterious locations;
- get the new experiences of the thrills of survival.

🎮 Download MadGran now and brace yourself for a spine-chilling horror adventure that will test your nerves, wits, and survival skills!
Can you outsmart her, solve the dark riddles, and get out the granny's house in the forest before it's too late?  It's time to find out!
